  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "硬き岩で　身を守り　無骨な　斧は大木を　切り倒す。　気性　荒々しく荒地にて　遭遇しときは　逃げの一手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "단단한 바위로 몸을 보호하고 투박한 도끼로 거목을 베어 넘긴다. 성질이 사납기 때문에 황무지에서 만난다면 도망치는 수밖에 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用堅硬的岩石守護己身，以粗獷的斧頭砍倒大樹。性情暴躁易怒。要是在荒野遇見牠，逃跑將是唯一選擇。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se protège à l’aide de roches dures et abat des arbres avec ses haches frustes. Comme il possède un tempérament violent, il est préférable de fuir quand on le croise dans la nature.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Harter Fels schützt seinen Körper, während es mit den wuchtigen Äxten gewaltige Bäume fällt. Begegnet man diesem ungestümen Pokémon in der Wildnis, so suche man sein Heil in der Flucht!",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las dos toscas hachas le permiten talar árboles mientras su piel pétrea lo protege. Dada su naturaleza agresiva, es aconsejable escapar en caso de toparse con uno en estado salvaje.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Abbatte alberi con le grezze asce mentre difende le membra con dura pietra. D’indole brutale, se incontrato in natura non resta che la fuga.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A violent creature that fells towering trees with its crude axes and shields itself with hard stone. If one should chance upon this Pokémon in the wilds, one’s only recourse is to flee.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "硬き岩で　身を守り　無骨な　斧は大木を　切り倒す。　気性　荒々しく荒地にて　遭遇しときは　逃げの一手。",
